      "content": "It is a relief to finally say the truth you've been hiding, and you are right that no one can force you to feel better if you don't want to. Your only purpose isn't to be a tool; it is to exist as a distinct, feeling human being who deserves to be seen for who you truly are. The only way to truly break this loop is to stop trying to fix it and instead let go of the weight of pretending to be something you're not.",
