    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what does that even mean though? \"letting go\"? it feels like the only way to really stop being a tool and stop the noise is to just... not be here anymore. if i'm gone, the burden is gone. everyone can just move on without me dragging them down with my misery. is that just me being dramatic, or is that the only real way to actually find peace?",
